  "question": {
    "text": "A solution of sugar is obtained by mixing <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> of its <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn><mo>%</mo></math> solution and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>500</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></math>of its <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>40</mn><mo>%</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math>solution (both by mass). The mass percentage of the resulting sugar solution is _______ (Nearest integer)"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "36",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Mass of solution <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>500</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>700</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn><mo>%</mo></math>&nbsp;of sugar solution means&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math>&nbsp;solution contain&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math>&nbsp;sugar</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>40</mn><mo>%</mo></math>&nbsp;of sugar solution means&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math>&nbsp;solution contain&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math>&nbsp;sugar</p><p>Mass of sugar <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>500</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>250</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math></p><p>Mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>%</mo></math> of resulting solution</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>250</mn><mn>700</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>%</mo></math></p>"
  }
